  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  speakerName: Shana
  DialogText:
  - 'As you can see it had a different effect. I think it''s about time I take a
    crack at it.  My skills are based on how high or low the Turn Count or Action
    Count is.  '
  - "I'll use Quake as an example. It\u2019s a skill that applies a special debuff
    Tremor on low turn count. The number of stacks applied is equal to my Action
    Count.  "
  - 'But once it reaches its threshold of Turn 15 or higher it becomes an attack
    skill that targets all enemies and deals Earth damage.  '
  - 'Now let''s give Quake a go. '
